<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-AUSTRALIAN MASTERS THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-AUSTRALIAN MASTERS THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading third round scores in</p>
<p>the Australian Masters golf tournament at the par-73 Huntingdale</p>
<p>course on Saturday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>204 Peter O'Malley 65 66 73</p>
<p>205 Lucas Parsons 64 67 74</p>
<p>206 Robert Allenby 70 66 70, Wayne Grady 70 67 69</p>
<p>207 Peter Lonard 69 69 69</p>
<p>209 Shane Tait 68 67 74, Mike Weir (Canada) 67 72 70, Rodger</p>
<p>Davis 72 65 72</p>
<p>210 Larry Mize (U.S.) 68 70 72, Tiger Woods (U.S.) 68 70 72</p>
<p>211 Peter Senior 69 68 74</p>
<p>212 Brett Partridge 70 71 71, Doug Dunakey (U.S.) 68 72 72,</p>
<p>Greg Chalmers 72 69 71, Shigenori Mori (Japan) 71 71 70, Rick</p>
<p>Gibson (Canada) 67 68 77</p>
<p>213 Stuart Bouvier 68 74 71, Craig Parry 73 70 70, Rodney</p>
<p>Pampling 73 71 69, Steven Conran 70 75 68, Leith Wastle 71 69</p>
<p>73, Simon Owen (New Zealand) 68 72 73</p>
